# The terminal on the FZ-M1 tablet turned to portrait (report 043, docs/PDA-PROFILE.md "Large screens: the tablet"):
# 800x1280 on the profile pda (rotate 90, 150x93 mm), the band shown with the key strip and Ctrl armed. Review only
# (no golden). The band's writing area is one third of the height, the key strip on top of it.
title pda tablet terminal
sizes 800x1280
review
profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_BOARD pc-fzm1-2
env APPLAUNCH_PANEL_MM 150x93
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
expect_zone hidden
launch CLI
ptyout "user@tablet:~$ "
wait 300
expect_zone shown
zonekey Ctrl
shot tablet_terminal_ctrl
